OL,3,GNEWSAWhen will the potholes on my road
OL,4,Abe fixed?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA list of roads set to be resurfaced as
OL,7,Fpart of work to crackdown on the number
OL,8,Fof potholes across Wolverhampton has
OL,9,Fbeen released by the council.
OL,11,FIt is part of the local authority's
OL,12,F#10m Highway Capital Programme for
OL,13,F2026-27. So far this year, more than
OL,14,F7,000 potholes have been fixed, the
OL,15,Fcouncil said.
OL,17,F"We can't resurface every road in the
OL,18,Fcity at once but by continually
OL,19,Ftargeting investment where it can have
OL,20,Fthe greatest impact, we can steadily
OL,21,Fraise the standard of our roads," said
OL,22,Fcouncillor Bhupinder Gakhal.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
